---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---
<Base
  title="About"
  description="The Crux gives you honest product reviews and sharp takes on what's trending — the signal, without the noise."
>
  <article class="container">
    <header class="page-head">
      <span class="meta-strip">About</span>
      <h1>Cut through the noise.</h1>
      <p>
        The Crux does two things: it tests products and tells you the one worth buying, and it cuts
        the day's noise down to the takes actually worth your time.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Reviews you can trust</h2>
      <p>
        Most "best of" lists are ranked by whoever pays the most. Ours aren't. We look at the serious
        options in a category, judge them on their merits, and name the one worth buying — and when
        nothing is, we say so. Some links are affiliate links, always disclosed, and the commission
        never decides the verdict.
      </p>

      <h2>The Brief</h2>
      <p>
        Alongside the reviews, we publish short, sharp takes on what's trending — the story, why it
        matters, and what to actually take away. No fifty-tab doomscroll, no filler.
      </p>

      <h2>How it's funded</h2>
      <p>
        Through affiliate commissions on products we recommend. That's it — no paywall, no spam. If a
        link earns us something, the page says so in plain sight.
      </p>

      <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
      <p>
        One person, in India. If something here is wrong, <a href="/contact/">tell us</a> and we'll
        fix it on the page where the mistake was.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
